<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>中风 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%8E/</link><description>Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 11:30:24 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%8E/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>远治法：论中风 臌胀 痿症 食炭</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-3-yuanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-3-yuanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“远治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;中风、臌胀、痿症、癫痫食炭&lt;/strong&gt;等经年累月、卧床日久之顽症的远期调治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病得之年远，非旦夕可效，然大剂峻补、攻逐或化痰开窍，配合特殊护理与服药方法，亦可起沉疴于垂危&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>中风历节病脉并第五</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/jingui-05/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Jun 2025 16:35:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/jingui-05/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇就是在说，怎么预防中风，治疗中风，什么人会得到中风。了解了之后，应该就不会得中风了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="夫风之为病当半身不遂或但臂不遂者此为痹脉微而数中风使然"&gt;&lt;span&gt;43 &lt;mark&gt;夫风之为病，当半身不遂，或但臂不遂者，此为痹。脉微而数，中风使然。&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e5%a4%ab%e9%a3%8e%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%ba%e7%97%85%e5%bd%93%e5%8d%8a%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%8d%e9%81%82%e6%88%96%e4%bd%86%e8%87%82%e4%b8%8d%e9%81%82%e8%80%85%e6%ad%a4%e4%b8%ba%e7%97%b9%e8%84%89%e5%be%ae%e8%80%8c%e6%95%b0%e4%b8%ad%e9%a3%8e%e4%bd%bf%e7%84%b6" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="病因病机"&gt;&lt;span&gt;43.1 病因病机&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e7%97%85%e5%9b%a0%e7%97%85%e6%9c%ba" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;气血两虚&lt;/strong&gt;是中风的主因，非单纯高血压所致。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;痹症定义&lt;/strong&gt;：麻木不仁，分风痹、血痹（与虚劳相关）。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;风痹表现&lt;/strong&gt;：肌表麻木、皮肤粗糙，或半身/单臂不遂，皆属气血两虚。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;注&lt;/strong&gt;：气血充足时中风，属表证（如桂枝汤证）；气血两虚时中风，则现中风症状。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>